Package: rchess
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Title: Chess Move Generation, Validation, and Visualization
Description: Tools for chess move generation and validation, piece placement
    and movement, game-state detection, and board visualization. Integrates
    bundled JavaScript libraries for chess rules and interactive board display.
